        "body": "Documentation and copy only. No file under `packages/*/src` changed; the runtime a user runs is identical to 0.3.10.\n\n- **The first screen is rewritten**: installed is not the same as working — three scenarios, one install line, the upgrade card and the evidence collapsed below.\n- **The version line left the first screen**, so a future release does not need to touch the pitch again.\n- **Two public sentences were wrong and are now true**: the README said both `0.3.10` and `latest=0.3.9` while npm served 0.3.10, and the listing credited 0.3.10 with adding the upgrade screen (it shipped earlier; 0.3.10 was tests and copy only).\n\nThis release exists so the npm page and the marketplace detail page carry the new first screen. Full changelog: `CHANGELOG.md`.\n"
      }
